  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 cup butter, softened",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "1.5 cups white sugar",
    "0.25 cup all-purpose flour",
    "4 eggs",
    "2 lemons, juiced"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/baJ-mVVNNXyjvTLaBV-rlgm7SMs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/10294-the-best-lemon-bars-DDMFS-step1-3x4--07512a5341294d1880f924f694502da8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10294/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the crust: Blend 2 cups flour, softened butter, and 1/2 cup sugar in a medium bowl until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/izQgpOaNDIpQ7d4CFugF4nxC7CA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/10294-the-best-lemon-bars-DDMFS-step2-1-3x4-0120-66fd8643c5384d29a4e88f73aa9a60a3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10294/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Press crust into the bottom of an ungreased 9x13-inch pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KXYVL6tWmZ_AEeP9iQs7TBDagaE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/10294-the-best-lemon-bars-DDMFS-step2-2-3x4-0121-76167b7952714a80971045a53e3d23ed.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10294/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake crust in the preheated oven until firm and golden, about 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HrhIcDjZz7VY9Z7VvSCwGSIw2Jk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/10294-the-best-lemon-bars-DDMFS-step3-3x4-0134-485b931f66e14df290f4ae24d1d4f86f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10294/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, make the filling: Whisk remaining 1 1/2 cups sugar and 1/4 cup flour in a medium bowl. Whisk in eggs, then lemon juice until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wxVKDpFLOtYMvnQQhXbZye6TAWI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/10294-the-best-lemon-bars-DDMFS-step5-1-3x4-0130-22ae18b5a4bb4a6d809bfaea57160a2e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10294/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour filling over the baked crust.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jl4Sz5O9b36CeOE5kj5_pa1qNrw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/10294-the-best-lemon-bars-DDMFS-step5-2-3x4-0135-096eb20a2568453284fea2fc1eaf743a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10294/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 20 minutes. Set the pan aside to cool completely; the bars will firm up as they cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/17Qzbb3JZY6TGPTusQxSEqxoZyw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/10294-the-best-lemon-bars-DDMFS-step6-3x4-01350187-cbe47cf22fba4aec95cda34b477b3fec.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10294/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "When cooled, cut bars into uniform squares.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Gg0DQ2lUeFy-k9U62AXuz7Bm_4o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/10294-the-best-lemon-bars-DDMFS-beauty-3x4-01350219-c15c4827648f476cbe0ab9bfd36859b9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10294/step_09.webp"
    }
